/* The minimum-norm right inverse of the first n columns of a 3 x 8 matrix, rank-safe: */
/* S = A A^T + eps I, eps = 1e-12 max(trace(S)/3, 1e-30); returns A^T S^-1 (8 x 3, rows past n zero). */
/* - a */
/* - n */
/* - returns p */
